@{
    Layout = null;
    ViewData["Title"] = "12 Week Recomp — Ignite Preview";
}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>12 Week Recomp — Ignite Preview</title>
    <meta name="description" content="A high-energy preview of the 12 Week Recomp method: training, nutrition, recovery, coaching and adaptive planning working together." />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/welcome-ignite-v1012.css" asp-append-version="true" />
</head>
<body class="wi-page">
    <div class="wi-noise" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="wi-progress" aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div>

    <header class="wi-nav-shell" data-wi-nav>
        <nav class="wi-nav" aria-label="Ignite preview navigation">
            <a class="wi-brand" href="/welcome-ignite" aria-label="12 Week Recomp Ignite preview">
                <span class="wi-brand-12">12</span><span class="wi-brand-week">WEEK</span><span class="wi-brand-recomp">RECOMP</span>
            </a>
            <div class="wi-nav-links">
                <a href="#method">Method</a>
                <a href="#engine">Engine</a>
                <a href="#coaching">Coaching</a>
                <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Evidence">Evidence</a>
            </div>
            <div class="wi-nav-actions">
                <a class="wi-link" asp-controller="Account" asp-action="SignIn">Sign In</a>
                <a class="wi-btn wi-btn-mini" href="/trial/start">Start Your 12 Weeks</a>
            </div>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section class="wi-hero" aria-labelledby="wi-hero-title">
            <div class="wi-hero-photo" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="wi-hero-vignette" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="wi-hero-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="wi-orb wi-orb-cyan" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="wi-orb wi-orb-green" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="wi-orb wi-orb-gold" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="wi-hero-ring" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="wi-hero-12" aria-hidden="true">12</div>

            <div class="wi-shell wi-hero-inner">
                <div class="wi-hero-copy" data-reveal>
                    <div class="wi-eyebrow"><span></span> 12 WEEKS TO BUILD SOMETHING DIFFERENT</div>
                    <h1 id="wi-hero-title">
                        REBUILD THE BODY.<br />
                        <span class="wi-cyan">RECLAIM THE DRIVE.</span><br />
                        <span class="wi-green">CHANGE WHAT COMES NEXT.</span>
                    </h1>
                    <p class="wi-hero-lede">
                        Stop treating training, food, recovery and motivation like separate problems.
                        12 Week Recomp connects them into one adaptive system built to help you get stronger,
                        reduce body fat, fuel better and keep moving forward.
                    </p>
                    <div class="wi-hero-actions">
                        <a class="wi-btn wi-btn-primary" href="/trial/start">Start Your 12 Weeks <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
                        <a class="wi-btn wi-btn-glass" href="#method">See How It Works <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
                    </div>
                    <div class="wi-proof-row" aria-label="Program approach">
                        <div><strong>NO</strong><span>CRASH DIETING</span></div>
                        <div><strong>YES</strong><span>REAL TRAINING</span></div>
                        <div><strong>DAILY</strong><span>ADAPTIVE DIRECTION</span></div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <aside class="wi-hero-console" data-reveal aria-label="Recomp system overview">
                    <div class="wi-console-top"><span>RECOMP SYSTEM</span><span class="wi-console-live"><i></i> ACTIVE</span></div>
                    <div class="wi-console-score"><small>ONE SYSTEM</small><strong>4 SIGNALS</strong><span>Training · Fuel · Recovery · Energy</span></div>
                    <div class="wi-console-grid">
                        <div><b>01</b><span>TRAIN</span><i class="cyan"></i></div>
                        <div><b>02</b><span>FUEL</span><i class="green"></i></div>
                        <div><b>03</b><span>RECOVER</span><i class="gold"></i></div>
                        <div><b>04</b><span>ADAPT</span><i class="cyan"></i></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="wi-console-wave" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
                    <p>Stop guessing what today should look like.</p>
                </aside>
            </div>
            <div class="wi-scroll-cue" aria-hidden="true"><span>SCROLL TO REBUILD</span><i></i></div>
        </section>

        <section class="wi-manifesto" aria-label="12 Week Recomp philosophy">
            <div class="wi-marquee" aria-hidden="true">
                <div>TRAIN WITH PURPOSE · EAT WITH PURPOSE · RECOVER WITH PURPOSE · BUILD MOMENTUM · </div>
                <div>TRAIN WITH PURPOSE · EAT WITH PURPOSE · RECOVER WITH PURPOSE · BUILD MOMENTUM · </div>
            </div>
            <div class="wi-shell wi-manifesto-grid">
                <div class="wi-manifesto-number" data-reveal>12</div>
                <div class="wi-manifesto-copy" data-reveal>
                    <p class="wi-kicker">THIS IS THE REBUILD</p>
                    <h2>NOT SMALLER.<br /><span>STRONGER.</span></h2>
                    <p>Recomp is not about winning a fight against food or seeing how little you can eat. It is about building a body that can work, recover and improve while body fat trends down over time.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="wi-manifesto-quote" data-reveal>
                    <span>THE GOAL</span>
                    <strong>Build a system you can actually live inside.</strong>
                    <p>Because the plan only matters if you can keep executing it.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="method" class="wi-method">
            <div class="wi-shell">
                <div class="wi-heading" data-reveal>
                    <p class="wi-kicker">THE 12 WEEK RECOMP METHOD</p>
                    <h2>FOUR LEVERS.<br /><span>ONE DIRECTION.</span></h2>
                    <p>Each lever changes the others. That is why the system treats your day as a whole.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="wi-method-grid">
                    <article class="wi-method-card wi-card-training" data-tilt data-reveal>
                        <div class="wi-method-media"></div><div class="wi-card-glow"></div><div class="wi-card-number">01</div>
                        <div class="wi-card-copy"><div class="wi-icon-ring">↗</div><small>TRAINING</small><h3>MAKE THE WORK MATTER.</h3><p>Resistance training creates the signal. Conditioning builds capacity. The goal is hard enough to drive change—not chaos for its own sake.</p><span>BUILD STRENGTH + CAPACITY</span></div>
                    </article>
                    <article class="wi-method-card wi-card-food" data-tilt data-reveal>
                        <div class="wi-method-media"></div><div class="wi-card-glow"></div><div class="wi-card-number">02</div>
                        <div class="wi-card-copy"><div class="wi-icon-ring wi-icon-green">◈</div><small>NUTRITION</small><h3>FUEL THE LIFE YOU WANT.</h3><p>Keep protein high. Put carbohydrate where it helps. Keep enough structure to move body fat without turning every meal into a test of willpower.</p><span>FUEL WITH INTENTION</span></div>
                    </article>
                    <article class="wi-method-card wi-card-recovery" data-tilt data-reveal>
                        <div class="wi-method-media"></div><div class="wi-card-glow"></div><div class="wi-card-number">03</div>
                        <div class="wi-card-copy"><div class="wi-icon-ring wi-icon-gold">◌</div><small>RECOVERY</small><h3>RECOVER LIKE IT COUNTS.</h3><p>Sleep, soreness, energy and recent workload are not background noise. They help determine whether today is a day to push, hold or recover.</p><span>PROTECT THE NEXT SESSION</span></div>
                    </article>
                    <article class="wi-method-card wi-card-adapt" data-tilt data-reveal>
                        <div class="wi-method-media"></div><div class="wi-card-glow"></div><div class="wi-card-number">04</div>
                        <div class="wi-card-copy"><div class="wi-icon-ring wi-icon-green">⚡</div><small>ADAPTATION</small><h3>LET THE PLAN MOVE WITH YOU.</h3><p>A plan should respond when your training, fuel or readiness changes. Recomp is built around adjustment—not pretending every day is identical.</p><span>KEEP MOMENTUM ALIVE</span></div>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="wi-breakfree">
            <div class="wi-breakfree-photo" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="wi-breakfree-shade" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="wi-shell wi-breakfree-inner">
                <div class="wi-breakfree-copy" data-reveal><p class="wi-kicker">BREAK FREE FROM THE OLD LOOP</p><h2>STOP STARTING OVER.</h2><p>The crash diet. The heroic Monday. The week of punishment. The rebound. 12 Week Recomp is designed around repeatable wins instead of dramatic resets.</p></div>
                <div class="wi-breakfree-stack" data-reveal><div><span>OLD LOOP</span><strong>RESTRICT → BURN OUT → RESTART</strong></div><div class="active"><span>RECOMP LOOP</span><strong>TRAIN → FUEL → RECOVER → ADAPT</strong></div></div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="engine" class="wi-engine">
            <div class="wi-engine-grid-bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="wi-shell wi-engine-layout">
                <div class="wi-engine-copy" data-reveal>
                    <p class="wi-kicker">THE RECOMP ENGINE</p><h2>YOUR DAY HAS SIGNALS.<br /><span>USE THEM.</span></h2>
                    <p>Training prescription, nutrition targets, glycogen demand, recovery and readiness belong in the same conversation. The Recomp engine brings them together so the plan can respond instead of simply repeat.</p>
                    <div class="wi-engine-points"><div><b>01</b><span><strong>SEE THE DAY</strong>Training + nutrition + readiness in one place.</span></div><div><b>02</b><span><strong>READ THE SIGNALS</strong>Understand when to push, fuel or protect recovery.</span></div><div><b>03</b><span><strong>MAKE THE NEXT MOVE</strong>Turn information into a practical decision.</span></div></div>
                </div>
                <div class="wi-engine-console" data-reveal>
                    <div class="wi-engine-topline"><span>ENGINE 3.0</span><span><i></i> TODAY</span></div>
                    <div class="wi-engine-hero-stat"><small>READINESS SIGNAL</small><strong>BUILD <em>MOMENTUM</em></strong><p>Enough recovery to train. Fuel aligned to the work. Keep the day controlled.</p></div>
                    <div class="wi-engine-stats"><div><small>TRAIN</small><strong>ON PLAN</strong><span class="ok">●</span></div><div><small>FUEL</small><strong>ALIGNED</strong><span class="ok">●</span></div><div><small>RECOVERY</small><strong>READY</strong><span class="ok">●</span></div></div>
                    <div class="wi-engine-bars"><div><span>TRAINING LOAD</span><i><b style="width:76%"></b></i><strong>76</strong></div><div><span>FUEL SUPPORT</span><i><b style="width:68%"></b></i><strong>68</strong></div><div><span>RECOVERY</span><i><b style="width:84%"></b></i><strong>84</strong></div></div>
                    <div class="wi-engine-command">EXECUTE THE NEXT WIN <span>→</span></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="coaching" class="wi-coaching">
            <div class="wi-coaching-media" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="wi-coaching-gradient" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="wi-shell wi-coaching-inner"><div class="wi-coaching-card" data-reveal><p class="wi-kicker">COACHING THAT CONNECTS THE DOTS</p><h2>YOU SHOULD KNOW<br /><span>WHY TODAY MATTERS.</span></h2><p>Practical coaching turns the system into action: what to train, how hard to push, how to fuel it, and what to protect when recovery is not where you want it.</p><div class="wi-coach-chips"><span>TRAINING DIRECTION</span><span>FUELING GUIDANCE</span><span>RECOVERY CONTEXT</span></div></div></div>
        </section>

        <section class="wi-proof">
            <div class="wi-shell">
                <div class="wi-heading wi-heading-center" data-reveal><p class="wi-kicker">NO MAGIC. NO MYSTERY.</p><h2>BUILT ON PRINCIPLES.<br /><span>DESIGNED FOR REAL LIFE.</span></h2></div>
                <div class="wi-proof-grid"><article data-reveal><div>01</div><strong>PROGRESSIVE TRAINING</strong><span>Use enough challenge to build or preserve muscle.</span></article><article data-reveal><div>02</div><strong>PROTEIN SUPPORT</strong><span>Give lean tissue what it needs while body fat trends down.</span></article><article data-reveal><div>03</div><strong>CARBOHYDRATE TIMING</strong><span>Use carbohydrate as fuel around demanding work.</span></article><article data-reveal><div>04</div><strong>ENERGY BALANCE</strong><span>Keep the larger weekly direction aligned with fat loss.</span></article><article data-reveal><div>05</div><strong>RECOVERY SIGNALS</strong><span>Adjust when readiness changes instead of forcing the script.</span></article><article data-reveal><div>06</div><strong>CONSISTENCY</strong><span>Stack enough good days that progress becomes the default.</span></article></div>
                <div class="wi-proof-action" data-reveal><a class="wi-btn wi-btn-glass" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Evidence">Read the Evidence <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="wi-final">
            <div class="wi-final-photo" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="wi-final-shade" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="wi-final-beam" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="wi-shell wi-final-inner" data-reveal><p class="wi-kicker">YOUR NEXT 12 WEEKS START SOMEWHERE</p><h2>BUILD THE BODY.<br />BUILD THE SYSTEM.<br /><span>BUILD WHAT COMES NEXT.</span></h2><p>You do not need another perfect Monday. You need a direction you can keep moving in.</p><div class="wi-hero-actions"><a class="wi-btn wi-btn-primary wi-btn-large" href="/trial/start">Start Free Trial <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="wi-btn wi-btn-glass wi-btn-large" href="#method">Explore the Method <span aria-hidden="true">↑</span></a></div></div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="wi-footer"><div class="wi-shell wi-footer-inner"><a class="wi-brand wi-brand-footer" href="/welcome-ignite"><span class="wi-brand-12">12</span><span class="wi-brand-week">WEEK</span><span class="wi-brand-recomp">RECOMP</span></a><p>Train. Fuel. Recover. Adapt.</p><div><a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Evidence">Evidence</a><a asp-controller="Contact" asp-action="Index">Contact</a><a asp-controller="Account" asp-action="SignIn">Sign In</a></div></div></footer>

    <script src="~/js/welcome-ignite-v1012.js" asp-append-version="true" defer></script>
@await Component.InvokeAsync("FreeUseOverlay")</body>
</html>
